5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"To ensure we make an objective choice, we should examine the actual utility of past projects. I suggest we look into the post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with the need for objectivity. To understand the operational impact, I would like to examine the timetable records on rooms out of service and the booking data for specialist and general rooms.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I believe we must consider the human element. I would like to look into the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines to see who is actually maintaining these facilities.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree that we need a data-driven approach. To avoid the recurring issue of budget overruns and scheduling delays, I will examine the tender records over three budget cycles and the weather days in the site diaries.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent start, everyone. To ensure our ambitions aren't merely fantasies on a spreadsheet, I shall examine the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier. Logic suggests the market rarely obeys our budgets.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"It seems we have a comprehensive spread of data. By combining user satisfaction with operational and financial records, we can avoid repeating past mistakes. I am satisfied with these selections.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"It is a balanced approach. By analyzing both the physical state of the buildings and the actual usage patterns, we can identify where the most critical gaps in our current infrastructure truly lie.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"It is a balanced list, indeed. However, let us not forget that facilities are only as good as the people who run them. I hope the data reveals where the pressure is most acute.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. While the human element is vital, we must also ensure the projects are actually deliverable. I want to see if our timelines are realistic or if we are consistently underestimating the site conditions.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. It would be a tragedy to select a plan based on a charming vision, only to discover the actual costs have drifted into the realm of fiction. I look forward to the revelations.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I believe we have covered all the necessary angles. Let us proceed to the investigation phase so we can bring these facts to the table.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I concur. Having a clear picture of how space is utilized and lost during construction will be essential for a rational decision. I am ready to proceed.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I agree. Let us see what the records tell us. I am particularly interested in whether the current workload on our staff is sustainable.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I am also ready. It is better to identify potential risks now than to face a crisis mid-construction. Let us see if the data supports our expectations.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Quite. I shall await the data with a mixture of curiosity and a healthy dose of skepticism. Let us hope the numbers are more honest than the proposals usually are.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"Since we are all in agreement, I believe we have exhausted the need for further discussion in this round. I look forward to reviewing the findings.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
